m off at\nthe table — everyone sees what you're playing with.\n\n⚡ BUILT TO BE QUICK\nMatches are short enough for a break and good enough to run one more.\nRuns smoothly on phone, tablet","thumbs":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-06dcafda6e1c7cbb8ef332b70760254d/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-7951ffdf23579e43733198d293e2973f/768/432/Image/Webp/noFilter"]}